    "detailed_description": "\ud83d\udd2eOpen your own cozy fortune-telling cafe: the Soulitaire <br>\ud83d\udc42Receive your guests. Listen to their troubles.<br>\u2728Lay the cards and divine their future! <br>\ud83d\udd00But be aware: Your interpretation will change the fate of their lives.<br><br><br>\ud83d\udc96Decide your customers\u2019 fate, and become a part of their life! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1953770/extras/d72e9bf98114e0ca816eabe85539a707.poster.avif?t=1752829975\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1953770/extras/d72e9bf98114e0ca816eabe85539a707.webm?t=1752829975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1953770/extras/d72e9bf98114e0ca816eabe85539a707.mp4?t=1752829975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>The game features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Enjoy a unique comic book art style<br></li><li> Interpret ambiguous soul cards to predict the future<br></li><li> Affect the lives of your friends and customers<br></li><li> Reveal the soul cards via dynamic solitaire<br></li><li> Use different solitaire skills based on character traits<br></li><li> Unravel a hidden mystery</li></ul>",
